#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:133
msgid ""
"The :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API should be used "
"with :c:type:`PyConfig` to set these options. Or :c:func:`PyConfig_Get` can "
"be used to get these options at runtime."
msgstr ""
"これらのオプションを設定するには、:c:type:`PyConfig` "
"と :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API を使ってください。\n"
"実行時に値を取得するには :c:func:`PyConfig_Get` を使えます。"
